**Ticket #4471** merged 412 unique reports into one issue. The reports describe three problems.

## 1. Day-first dates read month-first: 374 reports

The shared parser reads every date month first. For tenants that write the day first, day and month swap: "1 March" shows as "3 January". Covers 11 day-first locales, on app, email and booking-v2 form.

Issue: [gonlid/test#1](https://github.com/gonlid/test/issues/1)

## 2. booking-v3 form hint shows MM/DD: 33 reports

The form hint says MM/DD/YYYY. Users type what the hint tells them, and the form reads it the tenant's way. Same symptom as problem 1, different bug. Intake tagged 15 of these as `parser`.

Issue: [gonlid/test#2](https://github.com/gonlid/test/issues/2)

## 3. Dates land one day off: 5 reports

Weekday and date shift by one day, not a month flip. The desk counted these under problem 1. They are separate.

Issue: [gonlid/test#3](https://github.com/gonlid/test/issues/3)

## Counts

Problem 1 + problem 2 + problem 3 = 374 + 33 + 5 = **412** unique reports.

